===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂eǵ-|id=drive}}
Ultimately from {{der|en|la|congestus}}, perfect passive participle of {{m|la|congerō}}, from {{der|en|la|con-||"with, together"}} + {{m|la|gerō||"carry"}}. Compare {{m|en|digest}}, {{m|en|suggest}}.

===Pronunciation===
